0..76 Comment "// A run ridden along a flow whose target drops the move it took is refused."
77..79 Comment "//"
80..157 Comment "// The run took `retire`, which the narrowed protocol no longer offers, so no"
158..195 Comment "// run of the target holds its moves."
196..198 Comment "//"
199..273 Comment "// The ride moves the run by the simulation, and the monitor of the target"
274..309 Comment "// refuses it at the dropped offer."
310..312 Comment "//"
313..369 Comment "// - see: `../../ledger/features/session-identity.gandr`"
371..401 Comment "// The native session formers."
